You fire countless shots into the sky to rain down around your target, inflicting [95%, 110%, 121%, 131%, 140% (TL1-5)] weapon damage to all within radius [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)].

If the primary target is marked, you consume the mark to fire a second volley of arrows for [71%, 82%, 91%, 98%, 105% (TL1-5)] damage at no ammo cost.
